          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Coforge Q4 FY26 Profit More Than Doubles to Rs 612 Crore, Driven by AI Efficiencies and Deal Wins",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Coforge reported a 135% year-on-year surge in net profit to Rs 612 crore for Q4 FY26, surpassing street estimates, with strong revenue growth across healthcare and hi-tech verticals. The IT services firm attributed gains to AI-driven efficiencies and a robust pipeline of new deal wins. The result stands in contrast to the tepid growth reported by India's largest IT firms, suggesting mid-tier players are capturing AI-era benefits faster.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/information-tech/coforges-q4-profit-doubles-to-rs-612-crore-on-robust-deal-wins/articleshow/130837194.cms",
